  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0001",
      "text": "Router Swap Functions Lack Deadline Protection, Allowing Stale Transactions to Execute at Unfavorable Prices",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 108,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0002",
      "text": "## Vulnerability Details",
      "start": 110,
      "end": 134,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0003",
      "text": "### Finding Description and Impact",
      "start": 136,
      "end": 170,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0004",
      "text": "#### Overview",
      "start": 172,
      "end": 185,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0005",
      "text": "While auditing the Router contract, I discovered that **none of the swap functions include a deadline parameter**. This is a significant omission compared to industry standards - every major DEX (Uniswap V2/V3/V4, SushiSwap, Curve, PancakeSwap, etc.) implements deadline protection as a fundamental safety feature.",
      "start": 187,
      "end": 501,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0006",
      "text": "A deadline is a timestamp after which a pending transaction should revert if not yet executed. Without it, users cannot express: \"Execute my trade within the next N minutes, or don't execute it at all.\"",
      "start": 503,
      "end": 705,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0007",
      "text": "#### Technical Analysis",
      "start": 707,
      "end": 730,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0008",
      "text": "**Examining the Router's Swap Functions:**",
      "start": 732,
      "end": 774,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0009",
      "text": "Looking at [Router.sol#L208-L223](https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-11-ekubo/blob/main/src/Router.sol#L208-L223):",
      "start": 776,
      "end": 890,
      "line": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0010",
      "text": "All other swap function overloads at [Router.sol#L246-L277](https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-11-ekubo/blob/main/src/Router.sol#L246-L277) similarly lack deadline validation:",
      "start": 893,
      "end": 1068,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0011",
      "text": "**The SwapParameters Type Also Lacks Deadline:**",
      "start": 1071,
      "end": 1119,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0012",
      "text": "Looking at [swapParameters.sol#L1-L64](https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-11-ekubo/blob/main/src/types/swapParameters.sol#L1-L64), the packed struct contains:",
      "start": 1121,
      "end": 1279,
      "line": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0013",
      "text": "#### Comparison with Industry Standards",
      "start": 1282,
      "end": 1321,
      "line": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0014",
      "text": "**Uniswap V3 SwapRouter:**",
      "start": 1323,
      "end": 1349,
      "line": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0015",
      "text": "**Uniswap V2 Router:**",
      "start": 1352,
      "end": 1374,
      "line": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0016",
      "text": "#### Impact Scenarios",
      "start": 1377,
      "end": 1398,
      "line": 36
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0017",
      "text": "**Scenario 1: Network Congestion Attack**",
      "start": 1400,
      "end": 1441,
      "line": 38
    },
    {
      "id": "e_0c184e036d77_0018",
      "text": "**Scenario 2: Changed User Intent**",
